      <title>华强北成欧洲游客购物天堂，背后是产业升级与消费新趋势</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260822/%E5%8D%8E%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%97%E6%88%90%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E8%B4%AD%E7%89%A9%E5%A4%A9%E5%A0%82%E8%83%8C%E5%90%8E%E6%98%AF%E4%BA%A7%E4%B8%9A%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E6%96%B0%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF/</link>
